# consistency_chain: application × environment consistency, from a new key to its retirement (#179)

## 1. person: opv apply
1. create vault "e2e-app-app-dev" and item "e2e-app · app · dev values" for boundary app in dev
2. create vault "e2e-app-app-staging" and item "e2e-app · app · staging values" for boundary app in staging
3. create state vault "e2e-app-staging-gh-state" for target gh in staging
4. create vault "e2e-app-app-prod" and item "e2e-app · app · prod values" for boundary app in prod
5. create state vault "e2e-app-prod-gh-state" for target gh in prod
6. create delivery item "opv · delivery · app · gh" for app on target gh in prod
7. create delivery item "opv · delivery · app · gh" for app on target gh in staging
8. add empty secret field app/API_KEY to the app item in dev
9. add empty secret field app/OLD_KEY to the app item in dev
